  "description": "PUWHUL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H144 Gd4 Mn4 N8 O40,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.381-4.010 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.15-115.87°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C72H144Gd4Mn4N8O40·4(C2H3N). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Mn(III), Gd(III).",
